eneral-election polling available, the forecast rests on the district's partisan lean, the incumbency and fundraising gaps, and the strong expert consensus, all of which favor the Republican by a double-digit margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0643, "margin": -9.89}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0683, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0642, "margin": -11.0}]}